{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 7969710724735590245,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "IP Routing",
      "source_hash": 6677635199748935117,
      "context_hash": 4861647262515530715,
      "translation": "IP 라우팅",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177023Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "How the kernel decides where packets go: routing tables, lookups, and the FIB",
      "source_hash": 12202575995859660296,
      "context_hash": 5527185996365863209,
      "translation": "커널이 패킷의 목적지를 결정하는 방법: 라우팅 테이블, 조회, 그리고 FIB",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177024Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What routing does",
      "source_hash": 2243228043165833088,
      "context_hash": 158772932591165383,
      "translation": "라우팅이 하는 일",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177024Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For every packet — inbound or outbound — the kernel asks: \"where should this go?\" The routing subsystem answers:",
      "source_hash": 8189143090128281329,
      "context_hash": 13701281497964913028,
      "translation": "들어오는 패킷이든 나가는 패킷이든 모든 패킷에 대해 커널은 \"이 패킷을 어디로 보내야 하는가?\"라고 묻습니다. 라우팅 서브시스템은 다음과 같이 답합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "subsystem": "서브시스템"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177025Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Local delivery**: This packet is for us, send it up to a socket",
      "source_hash": 5587521518594006290,
      "context_hash": 16556540941356467556,
      "translation": "**로컬 전달**: 이 패킷은 자신에게 온 것이므로 소켓으로 올려 보냅니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177025Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Forward**: This packet is for someone else, find the next hop and transmit",
      "source_hash": 15608371831722482854,
      "context_hash": 8525432176938928704,
      "translation": "**포워딩**: 이 패킷은 다른 호스트로 가는 것이므로 다음 홉을 찾아 전송합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177026Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Unreachable**: No route to destination, send ICMP unreachable",
      "source_hash": 7745078475839775722,
      "context_hash": 8800829177432604280,
      "translation": "**도달 불가**: 목적지로 가는 경로가 없으므로 ICMP unreachable을 보냅니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177026Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The answer comes from the **FIB (Forwarding Information Base)** — the kernel's routing table.",
      "source_hash": 6379270786818714159,
      "context_hash": 17911700365693626374,
      "translation": "답은 커널의 라우팅 테이블인 **FIB**(Forwarding Information Base)에서 나옵니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177026Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The routing tables",
      "source_hash": 10245213107984629384,
      "context_hash": 4063169222211035015,
      "translation": "라우팅 테이블",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177026Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux supports multiple routing tables (for policy routing):",
      "source_hash": 7014600426825466527,
      "context_hash": 15264963943272550461,
      "translation": "Linux는 (정책 라우팅을 위해) 여러 개의 라우팅 테이블을 지원합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "policy": "정책"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177026Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "FIB internals: LC-trie",
      "source_hash": 2301530756122814161,
      "context_hash": 10718843451176983572,
      "translation": "FIB 내부 구조: LC-trie",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177026Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel implements the FIB as an **LC-trie** (Level Compressed trie, a.k.a. Patricia trie) for efficient longest-prefix matching:",
      "source_hash": 13816927445601215292,
      "context_hash": 7552730443374931055,
      "translation": "커널은 효율적인 최장 프리픽스 매칭(longest-prefix matching)을 위해 FIB를 **LC-trie**(Level Compressed trie, Patricia trie라고도 함)로 구현합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177027Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Lookup is `fib_table_lookup()`:",
      "source_hash": 13726115484344277704,
      "context_hash": 4983944784174884709,
      "translation": "조회는 `fib_table_lookup()`이 수행합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177027Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Route lookup: ip_route_input_noref()",
      "source_hash": 15499129672436258091,
      "context_hash": 1235401996546355928,
      "translation": "경로 조회: ip_route_input_noref()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177028Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "On receive, routing is called from `ip_rcv_finish()`:",
      "source_hash": 10805521013202614041,
      "context_hash": 8136164978923265624,
      "translation": "수신 시 라우팅은 `ip_rcv_finish()`에서 호출됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177028Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Route cache: dst_entry",
      "source_hash": 7815028254512043806,
      "context_hash": 13185078065255882884,
      "translation": "경로 캐시: dst_entry",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cache": "캐시"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177028Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Routing decisions are cached in `struct dst_entry`:",
      "source_hash": 10696435409877790376,
      "context_hash": 4796369205788161183,
      "translation": "라우팅 결정은 `struct dst_entry`에 캐시됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177028Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "On the transmit path, the route is cached in `sk->sk_dst_cache`:",
      "source_hash": 794012665448415136,
      "context_hash": 5968725604609456530,
      "translation": "송신 경로에서는 경로가 `sk->sk_dst_cache`에 캐시됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Policy routing",
      "source_hash": 3279109149067150402,
      "context_hash": 17603471520778356829,
      "translation": "정책 라우팅",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "policy": "정책"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux supports multiple routing tables and **rules** that select which table to use:",
      "source_hash": 5780796504822307614,
      "context_hash": 5305223788132626683,
      "translation": "Linux는 여러 개의 라우팅 테이블과 사용할 테이블을 선택하는 **규칙**을 지원합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Rules can match on:",
      "source_hash": 5956062397337592043,
      "context_hash": 4511520079353068377,
      "translation": "규칙은 다음 항목으로 매칭할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Source address (`from`)",
      "source_hash": 8593987137101069458,
      "context_hash": 6461546113256104249,
      "translation": "출발지 주소(`from`)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "address": "주소"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Destination address (`to`)",
      "source_hash": 2230117088262755223,
      "context_hash": 14268296736218274192,
      "translation": "목적지 주소(`to`)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "address": "주소"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Incoming interface (`iif`)",
      "source_hash": 15047728262483242619,
      "context_hash": 1612761807275177691,
      "translation": "수신 인터페이스(`iif`)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:7/seg:0",
