      "source_hash": 5688380865673683308,
      "context_hash": 15921639476289251301,
      "translation": "방화벽 마크(`fwmark`)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "TOS/DSCP field",
      "source_hash": 18003331729653935078,
      "context_hash": 9945120810564966033,
      "translation": "TOS/DSCP 필드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "ECMP: Equal Cost Multipath",
      "source_hash": 724202475429932269,
      "context_hash": 4587263452034119720,
      "translation": "ECMP: Equal Cost Multipath",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Multiple routes to the same destination with equal metric = ECMP:",
      "source_hash": 8991798445570206491,
      "context_hash": 2714744632470894966,
      "translation": "같은 목적지로 향하는 메트릭이 동일한 여러 경로 = ECMP:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Neighbor subsystem: ARP",
      "source_hash": 11323813390845658790,
      "context_hash": 1946832681997987713,
      "translation": "이웃 서브시스템: ARP",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "subsystem": "서브시스템"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "IP routing resolves to a next-hop IP, but transmission requires a MAC address.",
      "source_hash": 365587983731883082,
      "context_hash": 8437778678041177924,
      "translation": "IP 라우팅은 다음 홉 IP를 결정하지만, 실제 전송에는 MAC 주소가 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "address": "주소"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177031Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The **neighbor subsystem** maps IP → MAC via ARP:",
      "source_hash": 17888009827103547826,
      "context_hash": 4730773013969785807,
      "translation": "**이웃 서브시스템**은 ARP를 통해 IP → MAC 매핑을 수행합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "subsystem": "서브시스템"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:49.177031Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
